WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Ryu falls from the prerequisite corner throw.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.500
Raw Rush standing medium punch hits the recorded wake-up.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.250
Crouching heavy punch links after the Rush medium.

4
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:03.750
OD Arm of Justice and its forward heavy-punch follow-up connect.

5
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.700
Ryu ends in the corner knockdown.
